[[1024,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Observe the following precaution.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the recommended safety\ninstructions (see subgroup 5040 - AIR CONDITIONER CASING AND COMPONENTS)</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Drain the coolant (\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a>\n                                           ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238435\">5530B52</a></p><p>1. Undo the nut and disconnect the connector.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Seal the disconnected connectors,\nusing suitable plugs, to prevent humidity and impurities from entering\nthe system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070045.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,16,"<p>1. Undo the bolt and disconnect the connector (1a) from the condenser\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070046.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,16,"<p>Raise the car.</p><p>1. Working underneath the radiator, open the retaining band (1a)\nand remove the pipe (1b) from the condenser to the evaporator.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070047.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pipe is not damaged or cracked.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the O-rings for the connectors.\nOnly use green coloured seals, resistant to R134A refrigerant. Lubricate\nthe thread of the connectors using anti-freeze.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Place the pipe in position and secure it\nusing the retaining band.</p><p>Connect the connector for the pipe to the\ncondenser and tighten the bolt.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.3</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the intermediate connector and\ntighten the nut.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238435\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a></p><p>Repressurize using coolant fluid (\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a>\n                                           ).</p>"]]